menu "Task Norm configuration"

	menu "Task #1 configuration"
		config DECL_TASK_NORM_1_NAME
			string "Name of task #1"
			default "TASK_NORM_1"

			help

				This is the name of task norm, please use upper case.

				Prefer like eg. `TASK_NORM_A`, `TASK_NORM_USR`

				This is only used for internal identification.

		config DECL_MSG_QUEUE_1_NAME
			string "Name of message queue #1"
			default "MSG_QUEUE_1"
			depends on DECL_TASK_NORM_1_NAME != ""

			help

				This is the name of task norm message queue.

				Format output as extern uedp_msg_t* <value>_msgq[UEDP_MSG_BLANK_QUEUE_SIZE];.

				Usually prefer eg. `tnorm_a` to produce `tnorm_a_msgq[UEDP_MSG_BLANK_QUEUE_SIZE]`.

		config DECL_NORM_HANDLER_1_NAME
			string "Name of handler #1"
			default "NORM_HANDLER_1"
			depends on DECL_TASK_NORM_1_NAME != ""

			help

				This is the name of task norm handler.

				Format output as void <value>_nhler(uedp_msg_t* msg);.

				Usually prefer eg. `tnorm_a` to produce `tnorm_a_nhler(uedp_msg_t* msg);`.

	endmenu

