endmenu
menu "Signal configuration"

	menu "Signal #1 configuration"
		config DECL_SIG_1_NAME
			string "Name of signal #1"
			default "SIG_1"

			help

				This is the name of signal, please use upper case.

				Prefer like eg. `SIG_A`, `SIG_USR`

				This is only used for internal identification.

				The value is emitted as a C preprocessor symbol and should not use the `_ID` suffix.

	endmenu

